y right now, the included example doesn't work for dispose:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/examples/custom_attributes/custom_management.py b/examples/custom_attributes/custom_management.py\r\nindex 6cddfe7bd1..3613205c0f 100644\r\n--- a/examples/custom_attributes/custom_management.py\r\n+++ b/examples/custom_attributes/custom_management.py\r\n@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ from sqlalchemy import MetaData\r\n from sqlalchemy import Table\r\n from sqlalchemy import Text\r\n from sqlalchemy.ext.instrumentation import InstrumentationManager\r\n-from sqlalchemy.orm import mapper\r\n+from sqlalchemy.orm import clear_mappers, mapper\r\n from sqlalchemy.orm import relationship\r\n from sqlalchemy.orm import Session\r\n from sqlalchemy.orm.attributes import del_attribute\r\n@@ -122,3 +122,5 @@ if __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n \r\n     a1 = sess.query(A).get(a1.id)\r\n     assert len(a1.bs) == 1\r\n+\r\n+    clear_mappers()\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n   mapperlib._dispose_registries(mapperlib._all_registries(), False)\r\n  File \"/home/classic/dev/sqlalchemy/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/mapper.py\", line 3462, in _dispose_registries\r\n    reg._dispose_manager_and_mapper(manager)\r\n  File \"/home/classic/dev/sqlalchemy/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/decl_api.py\", line 728, in _dispose_manager_and_mapper\r\n    instrumentation._instrumentation_factory.unregister(class_)\r\n  File \"/home/classic/dev/sqlalchemy/lib/sqlalchemy/ext/instrumentation.py\", line 162, in unregister\r\n    super(ExtendedInstrumentationRegistry, self).unregister(class_)\r\n  File \"/home/classic/dev/sqlalchemy/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/instrumentation.py\", line 540, in unregister\r\n    manager.unregister()\r\nAttributeError: 'NoneType' object has no attribute 'unregister'\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm not sure about your use of `instrumentation._instrumentation_factory.manager_of_class` which seems to sidestep that part, ideally you would not have to access any private variables to accomplish what you need. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"u